<title>USA: Botetourt Cty IDA, Va., yields 4.55 pct in 2000.</title>
<headline>Botetourt Cty IDA, Va., yields 4.55 pct in 2000.</headline>
<text>
<p>PRELIMINARY PRICING</p>
<p>IDA OF BOTETOURT COUNTY, VIRGINIA</p>
<p>RE: $5,000,000*</p>
<p>LEASE  REVENUE NOTES</p>
<p>SCHOOL CONSTRUCTION PROJECT</p>
<p>SEREIS 1997</p>
<p>BANK QUALIFIED</p>
<p>MOODY'S: NR		    S&amp;P: NR</p>
<p>DATED: 06/01/1997	    FIRST COUPON: 01/15/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 01/15</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>01/15/2000		5,000M    4.55  %	  4.55</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 06/01/1998    100.00</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Tuesday, June 17, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on July 1, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry.  DTC is pending.</p>
<p>Wheat First Butcher Singer</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
